flowchart LR
    subgraph Flight Envelope
        direction TB
        A[Speed Axis<br/>KIAS/Mach] --> B[VMO/MMO<br/>Mach 0.78]
        C[Altitude Axis<br/>feet] --> D[Max Certified<br/>TBD ft]
        E[Load Factor<br/>G] --> F[+2.5 G / -1.0 G<br/>Clean Config]
    end

    subgraph Configurations
        G[Clean] --> H[Flaps 1]
        H --> I[Flaps 2]
        I --> J[Full Flaps]
    end

    subgraph Limits Reduction
        G -.-> |Full Envelope| K[Normal Ops]
        J -.-> |Reduced Envelope| L[Landing Only]
    end
